                                         CO-META:hasType CO-META:PheromoneAddition .


###  https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ACO_parameter_pheromone_evaporation
CO-META:ACO_parameter_pheromone_evaporation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
