                                            CO-META:hasType CO-META:PheromoneEvaporation .


###  https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ACO_parameter_pheromone_influence
CO-META:ACO_parameter_pheromone_influence rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                   CO-META:ParameterValue ;
                                          CO-META:hasType CO-META:PheromoneInfluence .


###  https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ACO_parameter_populationsize
CO-META:ACO_parameter_populationsize rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
