###  https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ACO_stop
CO-META:ACO_stop rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                          CO-META:StoppingCriterionComponent ;
                 CO-META:hasOutput CO-META:ACO_construction_pheromones .


###  https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#HeuristicInfluence
CO-META:HeuristicInfluence rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                    CO-META:FloatParameter ;
